        "id": 90520,
        "name": "Envisioner",
        "username": "Envisioner",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-10T20:16:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I contend that it is impossible for any but the simplest effects (and questionably even those) to be \"simultaneous\".&nbsp; Certainly not a card play, nor even damage type changing.&nbsp; And there can be issues even with damage adjustment, as with my recent question on Twist the Ether vs. Cramped Quarters Combat.</p>",
