      {
        "id": 90525,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-11T02:31:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>They are triggered simultaneously, and the rules state that when two effects would try to be simultaneous they aren't.</p><p>So yes, nothing is simultaneous, but when they would try to be you resolve them in an order determined by the rules, which in this case would be player choice.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
